Pierce Proficiency represents your training with thrusting weapons such as
daggers, rapiers, spears, and similar armaments. These weapons deal damage
by puncturing armor and flesh with concentrated force at a single point.

Higher proficiency increases your accuracy and effectiveness with piercing
weapons. As you advance, you learn proper thrusting techniques, targeting
of vital areas, and methods to slip your blade through gaps in armor.

Piercing weapons are favored by thieves for their precision and their
effectiveness in backstab attacks. They can be particularly deadly when
targeting vital organs. Like slashing weapons, they require regular
maintenance with the "sharpen" skill.

Once you have achieved sufficient proficiency in piercing weapons, you may
pursue Pierce Specialization for additional attacks per round.

